I don't think this will work, because there's an upper limit to your
satiation level beyond which you will choke (or vomit and lose
nutrition with an AoMB).  So if no fire giants turn up for 15000
turns, you will starve, no matter how satiated you were before.  While
the probability of no fire giants turning up during a specific 15000
turns is very low, if you play long enough, the probability of it
happening at least once (and killing you) tends to 1.

To fix this strategy up, assume that you have an icebox and can
therefore save excess corpses for the lean times (and perhaps be
something other than a valkyrie, since fire giant corpses are close to
too heavy to lift).

Another possible problem: can you prove that it would be absolutely
impossible for the fire giants ever to kill you?
